      "source": "The training ship 'Fisgard' (?) off the Royal Naval College, Greenwich, in 1877 label QS:Len,\"The training ship 'Fisgard' (?) off the Royal Naval College, Greenwich, in 1877\"Alternative title(s): The training ship 'Fisgard' (?) off the Royal Naval College, Greenwich, in 1877 label QS:Len,\"A view of Greenwich in 1877 with the training ship HMS Warspite\"",
